                        5844 --1999: /**********************************************************************************************************************
                        5845 --2000: * Function Name : r_pkcd_ec_affine_to_projective
                        5846 --2001: **********************************************************************************************************************/
                        5847 --2002: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        5848 --2003:  * \ingroup     PKCDECAPIsInternal
                        5849 --2004:  * \brief       Convert from affine coordinates to projective coordinates.
                        5850 --2005:  * \param       [in]  p_x            An address of affine x-coordinate.
                        5851 --2006:  * \param       [in]  p_y            An address of affine y-coordinate.
                        5852 --2007:  * \param       [in]  curve_len      A byte size of curve length.
                        5853 --2008:  * \param       [out] p_wk_xyz_out   An address of work area where projective coordinates after conversion are set.
                        5854 --2009:  * \return
                        5855 --2010:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
