                        5891 --2046:  *    Copy the calculation result to x area of p_wk_xyz_out with #r_pkcd_cmn_cpy_by_64bounds.
                        5892 --2047:  * -# Calculate y*R (or y*R*2^64 if if #PKCD_CFG_OVF_WORKAROUND_ENABLE is 1
