                        5894 --2049:  *    with the #r_pkcd_cmn_ABRInvModC.
                        5895 --2050:  *    Copy the calculation result to y area of p_wk_xyz_out with #r_pkcd_cmn_cpy_by_64bounds.
                        5896 --2051:  * -# Calculate R (or R*2^64 if if #PKCD_CFG_OVF_WORKAROUND_ENABLE is 1
