                        7285 --2453:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR (DL bit) and #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPW value must have been set beforehand.
                        7286 --2454:  * \par Detailed description
                        7287 --2455:  *  - Set #PKCD_EC_NWORK and #PKCD_EC_PWORK.
