                        7943 --2657:  * \param       [out] p_wk_out          An address of work area where top n bits of digest.<br>
                        7944 --2658:  *                                      The data is set at the bottom.
                        7945 --2659:  * \return
                        7946 --2660:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        7947 --2661:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted
                        7948 --2662:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        7949 --2663:  * \par Security components
                        7950 --2664:  *  - No
                        7951 --2665:  * \par Global Variables
                        7952 --2666:  *  - #PKCD_EC_OFFSET_VAL
                        7953 --2667:  * \par Registers Used
                        7954 --2668:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0CR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STR, <br>
