                        7959 --2673:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR (DL bit) value must have been set beforehand.
                        7960 --2674:  * \par Detailed description
                        7961 --2675:  *  - Digest uses the n bit on the most significant side. n is the bit length of order.
                        7962 --2676:  * \par Remarks
